1. INTRODUCTION

This Privacy Policy explains how Jerico collects, uses, and protects information when you use the FUJI VPN
mobile application ("the App") on your Android device.

FUJI VPN is a virtual private network (VPN) application. It creates an
encrypted connection between your device and our servers so that your
internet traffic is routed through those servers.

By installing or using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do
not agree, please do not use the App.


